<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>开场 / 问题</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>AI 能写代码，早就不是问题了</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.32)", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -1}}>能写</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 14, marginTop: 26, marginBottom: 26}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 1, background: "#A32D2D"}}></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "#A32D2D", letterSpacing: 1}}>断裂</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -1}}>能不能上线</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 20, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>能写</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.55}}>生成能力——这两年提升的就是这个，而且还在涨。</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>能不能上线</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.55}}>要有人签、要能查、要能还原、要团队接得住。<br />这一层，这两年并没有跟着一起涨。</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", padding: 24, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.4}}>Q</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.55}}>你们团队里最会写 prompt 的那个人，<br />和刚上手的新人，交出来的质量一样吗？</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>02 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
